# The Speed Demon: "At the beginning of your end step, you draw X cards and lose X life, where X is your speed." X is read as the
# ability resolves (CR 608.2h), not when it triggers. Cast on turn 1 (speed 1, CR 702.179), its end-step trigger goes on the
# stack at speed 1; in response Bot1 Lightning Bolts Bot2, the first life an opponent has lost on Bot1's turn, raising the speed
# to 2 (CR 702.179d). The trigger then has Bot1 draw 2 and lose 2 (18), not 1.

